WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.690
A successful recurrence check records a test, not a second repair.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:09.610
Open the due check and use the original ticket information to identify the same asset.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.680
Repeat the test that previously reproduced the fault.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.400
If the equipment now passes, select No recurrence.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.190
Check the recorded outcome, then open the original ticket to see the check schedule.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:23.210
A later check may still be due.
